//Lackey Collection
"Croatoa_Lackey" "The manuscripts in this section are dedicated to the work of Mercedes Lackey.  Judging from the wear and tear on these volumes, you can't help but wonder if students have been spending a little less time on their schoolwork and a little more time buried in Ms. Lackey's dark and haunting universe."
